@startuml
!include ../../diagrams/style.iuml
title AI 域名日报数据流
top to bottom direction

actor "普通数据面" as normal #E0F2FE
component "xray-ai-domain-manager\n每小时" as manager #CCFBF1
database "panel.db\nai_domains + ai_domain_observations" as paneldb #FEF3C7
folder "小时域名报表\nhistory/*.json" as hourly #F3E8FF
component "xray-ops-attribution-sampler\n可选脱敏 counter 快照" as sampler #FAD7A0
database "ops.db\nHMAC user/inbound counter" as opsdb #E5E7EB
component "xray-ops-daily-reporter\nAsia/Shanghai 自然日" as reporter #DBEAFE
component "Codex\n运维解释" as codex #FCE7F3
folder "本地日报\nJSON / Markdown" as reports #FEF3C7
folder "GitHub 归档\nops-daily-reports/<year>" as archive #E5E7EB

normal --> manager : access.log 域名增量
manager --> paneldb : AI 分类与每小时命中
manager --> hourly : 域名、分类、路由状态
hourly --> reporter : 日窗口聚合
paneldb --> reporter : 只读补充历史/来源/模型
sampler --> opsdb : HMAC 后的聚合 counter
opsdb --> reporter : 可选窗口增量归因
reporter --> codex : 有界 AI 分类摘要 + 规则证据
codex --> reporter : 受 schema 约束的解释
reporter --> reports : ai_domain_analysis\n本地原子写入
reporter --> archive : 成功报告后尝试发布

note right of reporter
每个域名输出：
分类、命中次数、
direct / ai_proxy / mixed、
Codex 来源和理由。
历史路由缺失则 unknown。
用户与 inbound 是同一流量的两种视角。
GitHub 发布失败不会撤销本地报告成功。
end note
@enduml
